# Benchmark frames

The ice, liquid and interface frames from about 1k to 110k molecules are
built by `python3.12 scripts/h2h_cpc.py prepare <name>`. Ice is the
cubic lattice. Liquid and the interface replicate
`input/traj/dump-l.lammpstrj`. The written dumps stay out of git.

Those frames are destined for a Hugging Face dataset repository, or for
DVC once a remote exists. A fetch script can be added once that
repository exists.

Until the frames are published, the neighbour, ring and CHILL+ runs
build a missing frame. Liquid and interface systems are skipped when
the seed trajectory is absent.
